 "about": "The verbs of the swarm graph in Neo4j (neo4j.1.fringe@PrompTugal.dinis, WS-215). The grammar is the fractal semantic graph grammar (Dinis Cruz, newsroom.sgit.ai; admin/build/graph-model.mjs GRAMMAR): every edge is a verb with a subject and an object, and it has an inverse a person would say. There is no relates_to. The loader refuses any relationship type that is not listed here. Neo4j stores one direction; the inverse is a property of every relationship ('inverse') and of the :Verb catalogue node.",
